019 AND FEBRUARY 20, 2020 MAY CONTACT THE THORNTON LAW FIRM'S INVESTOR PROTECTION TEAM BY VISITING WWW.TENLAW.COM/CASES/FIRST-SOLAR-INC FOR MORE INFORMATION. INVESTORS MAY ALSO EMAIL..."}{'symbol': 'FSLR', 'date': '2022-02-18 09:30:00', 'title': 'FSLR SHAREHOLDER ALERT: JAKUBOWITZ LAW REMINDS FIRST SOLAR SHAREHOLDERS OF A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF MARCH 8, 2022', 'text': 'NEW YORK, FEB. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0JAKUBOWITZ LAW ANNOUNCES THAT A SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS COMMENCED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF FIRST SOLAR, INC. (NASDAQ: FSLR). TO RECEIVE UPDATES ON THE LAWSUIT, FILL OUT THE FORM: HTTPS://CLAIMYOURLOSS.COM/SECURITIES/FIRST-SOLAR-INC-LOSS-SUBMISSION-FORM/?ID=23808&FROM=4 THIS LAWSUIT IS ON BEHALF OF ALL PERSONS OR ENTITIES THAT PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED SHARES OF FIRST SOLAR COMMON STOCK BETWEEN FEBRUARY 22, 2019, AND FEBRUARY 20, 2020, INCLUSIVE.'}